            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Support multi line surround, for example, having config:\r\n```lua\r\n    ['{'] = {\r\n      input = {find = '%b{}', extract = '^(.%s*).-(%s*.)$'},\r\n      output = {left = '{ ', right = ' }'},\r\n    }\r\n```\r\nand text\r\n```c\r\nfor (i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\r\n    printf(\"%d\\n\", i);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n`sd{` result\r\n```c\r\nfor (i = 0; i < 10; i++) printf(\"%d\\n\", i);\r\n```",
