            "body": "Thank you so much for this! I'd implement this from the start if new it doesn't add *that* much complexity.\r\n\r\nBuuut... This is a really crazy coincidence. *Today* I have started coding for #103 and the first step is to implement multiline surroundings. Which I am wrapping up right now (ended up mostly similar to your solution). It will get merged after all work #103 is done.\r\n\r\nSorry, but I am going with my solution. This ended up as the prime example of why I ask people to open an issue before doing a PR :(",
